{title: Blessed Assurance}
{artist: Fanny Crosby & Phoebe Knapp}
{key: D}
{time: 9/8}
{tempo: 92}

Verse 1
[D]Blessed as[G]surance, [D]Jesus is [A]mine —
O what a [G]foretaste of [D]glory di[A]vine!
[D]Heir of sal[G]vation, [D]purchase of [Bm]God,
[D]born of his [A]Spirit, [G]washed in his [D]blood.

Chorus
[D]This is my [G]story, [D]this is my song:
praising my [E]Savior all the day [A]long.
[D]This is my [G]story, [D]this is my [Bm]song:
[D]praising my [A]Savior [G]all the day [D]long.

Verse 2
[D]Perfect submission, perfect delight, [D]Visions of rapture now [A]burst on my sight;
Angels descending bring from above Echoes [G]of mercy, whispers of [D]love. This is my
[D]story, this is my song, Praising [D]my Savior, all the [Bm]day long;
[D]This is my story, this is [A]my song, [G]Praising my Savior, all the [D]day long.

Verse 3
[D]Perfect submission, all is [D]at rest I in my [A]Savior am happy and
blest, Watching and waiting, looking above, [G]Filled with His goodness, lost [D]in His love. This
[D]is my story, this is my [D]song, Praising my Savior, all [Bm]the day
[D]long; This is my story, this [A]is my [G]song, Praising my Savior, all the [D]day long.
